{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f <strong>&quot;I AM FOOTBALL&quot;</strong> \ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f<br>A game of soccer where you\u2019re not the player. You\u2019re not the coach. You\u2019re not even the ref. You... <strong>ARE THE BALL.</strong> \u26bd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf89 <strong>THE COMPLETELY UNNECESSARY BACKSTORY</strong> \ud83c\udf89</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Steve the Striker,</strong> once the king of the pitch, now... a ball. \u26bd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steve had it all: fame, fortune, and a flawless haircut. But it wasn\u2019t enough. Obsessed with scoring <i>even more goals,</i> Steve turned to the infamous Dr. Drepane, who promised to make him <i>\u201cone with the game.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And boy, did he deliver. \ud83e\udee0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, Steve <i>is</i> the football. His perfectly chiselled abs? Rounded into a perfect sphere. His face? Somewhere under those panels. His only way out? <strong>Earn $1 million by scoring goals</strong> (as himself!) so Dr. Drepane will undo his own <i>&quot;masterpiece&quot;</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 But there\u2019s a catch. If Steve fails, he stays a ball... forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live Steve\u2019s nightmare:</strong> Avoid cleats, headers, and being punted across the pitch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score goals to survive:</strong> Earn cash for every goal you score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic time-keeping:</strong> Each mob that touches you subtracts precious time from the clock.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop being kicked around. Be the ball. Be <strong>unstoppable.</strong> \ud83c\udfc6</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Teams</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Black Sheep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The White Knights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blue Collars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Green Thumbs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gold Diggers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Silver Spoons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bronze Age</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Marooned Sailors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Purple Haze</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Red Flags</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys / WASD ..........................................Roll around</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SpaceBar...............................................................Pause game</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604010?t=1749998369","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604010?t=1749998369","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604010/cba4d4c4c42c8052b6fcde7418feeec20aec0380/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749998369","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604010/cba4d4c4c42c8052b6fcde7418feeec20aec0380/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749998369","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f <strong>&quot;I AM FOOTBALL&quot;</strong> \ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f<br>A game of soccer where you\u2019re not the player. You\u2019re not the coach. You\u2019re not even the ref. You... <strong>ARE THE BALL.</strong> \u26bd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf89 <strong>THE COMPLETELY UNNECESSARY BACKSTORY