oned Sailors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Purple Haze</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Red Flags</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys / WASD ..........................................Roll around</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SpaceBar...............................................................Pause game</p>","developers":["Entertainment Software International"],"genres":[{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604010/5bb7074191f8603894e4c2ddadac573ba787f924/header.jpg?t=1749998369","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Entertainment Software International \u00a9 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3604010/856683/c8fc27f158b0b7dc1274328c08a38ce148fe33c2/1750448874/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742808153","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3604010/856683/c8fc27f158b0b7dc1274328c08a38ce148fe33c2/1750448874/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742808153","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3604010/856683/c8fc27f158b0b7dc1274328c08a38ce148fe33c2/1750448874/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1742808153","id":257117923,"name":"goal","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117923/1f0d1ea099ced30ca1d7648387c3bbcaf5c758e0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742808153"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3604010/856687/869f6254824a7debafa20e00f3617cdc10094cc5/1750448877/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742808156","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3604010/856687/869f6254824a7debafa20e00f3617cdc10094cc5/1750448877/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742808156","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3604010/856687/869f6254824a7debafa20e00f361